      "actions": 1,
      "traits": [
        "concentrate"
      ],
      "description": "<p>The adept concentrates to muster knowledge and wisdom. While focusing, they gain a +2 status bonus to checks to Recall Knowledge, but take a –2 penalty to Perception. They can Dismiss this focused state.</p>",
